    "title": "Local man faces burglary charge - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Writer ,\n5 hours ago\nLITTLE TORCH KEY — A 70-year-old local man was arrested Wednesday, Nov. 26, after allegedly breaking into a woman’s home.\nTheodore William Wiersma was charged with burglary of an unoccupied residence and possession of drug paraphernalia.\nDeputies received a phone call from a woman stating her ex-boyfriend, identified as Wiersma, was seen surveillance video breaking into her Coral Shores Road residence via window. Deputies arrived at 12:52 a.m. to find Wiersma inside the residence, reports say. Drug paraphernalia was found inside the residence, which Wiersma allegedly said was his. He also allegedly admitted to using drugs inside the residence prior to the arrival of deputies.\nWiersma was taken to jail.",
